# Grasp server secret (server-side ONLY — never a VITE_ variable, never
# shipped to browsers). Get one at https://dev.meta.ai
# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored.
META_API_KEY=
# Optional overrides:
# META_API_BASE=https://api.meta.ai/v1
# META_MODEL=muse-wonder-1.0
# PORT=8787
